FlashMLASparse vendored kernel — MIT license attribution
=========================================================

This directory contains CUDA kernels for the DeepSeek V4 Lightning Indexer,
adapted from two MIT-licensed upstream sources:

1. sgl-project/FlashMLA  (https://github.com/sgl-project/FlashMLA)
   Copyright (c) 2025 DeepSeek
   File-level sources used: csrc/sm90/decode/sparse_fp8/* (algorithm shape),
   csrc/api/sparse_decode.h (API surface inspiration).

2. sgl-project/sglang   (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang)
   Copyright (c) 2025 SGLang contributors
   File-level sources used:
     - python/sglang/jit_kernel/csrc/deepseek_v4/topk_v1.cuh
       (radix-256 two-stage top-k selection — basis for topk_radix.cu)
     - python/sglang/srt/layers/attention/dsv4/tilelang_kernel.py
       (fp8_paged_mqa_logits scoring algorithm — basis for indexer_score.cu;
        we use the BF16 dense variant; FP8 paged variant is rental-day-2 work)

The Arc-specific modifications and the BF16/F32 dense rewrite are:
   Copyright (c) 2026 Arc / Runcrate

